  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1204.37 Strippable booth coating",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1204.37 \"Strippable booth coating\" means a coating that is:\n\n(a) Applied to a booth wall to provide a protective film to receive overspray during finishing operations; and\n\n(b) Subsequently peeled off and disposed.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
